ble","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["HP %"],"h":1},{"c":["Buff Duration"],"h":1},{"c":["Might Multiplier"],"h":1},{"c":["Speed Bonus"],"h":1},{"c":["Area Bonus"],"h":1},{"c":["Cooldown Bonus"],"h":1},{"c":["Weapon Activation Amount Bonus"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["100% - 75%"]},{"c":["5 s"]},{"c":["1x"]},{"c":["+30%"]},{"c":["+75%"]},{"c":["-20%"]},{"c":["1 extra activation"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["75% - 25%"]},{"c":["7.5 s"]},{"c":["2x"]},{"c":["+30%"]},{"c":["+100%"]},{"c":["-40%"]},{"c":["2 extra activations"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["25% - 0%"]},{"c":["10 s"]},{"c":["3x"]},{"c":["+30%"]},{"c":["+125%"]},{"c":["-60%"]},{"c":["3 extra activations"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Calogero enjoys having the ",{"i":"Sprite-Slash_(XVI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:slash-xvi"}," ",{"t":"Slash (XVI)","r":"arcana:slash-xvi"}," Arcana, as his starting weapon thrives on dishing out hideously powerful critical hits when evolved into ",{"i":"Sprite-Bloodlust.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:bloodlust"}," ",{"t":"Bloodlust","r":"weapon:bloodlust"},"."]},{"c":["As ",{"i":"Sprite-Bloodlust.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:bloodlust"}," ",{"t":"Bloodlust","r":"weapon:bloodlust"},", the evolution of his starting weapon, has special interaction with ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},", Calogero greatly benefits from the ",{"i":"Sprite-Beginning_(X).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:beginning-x"}," ",{"t":"Beginning (X)","r":"arcana:beginning-x"}," Arcana."]},{"c":["Calogero can also be built as a ",{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," user, as he has special interaction with retaliation which increases in potency based on his missing health."]},{"c":["Strongly consider using ",{"i":"Sprite-Muramasa.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:muramasa"}," ",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"},", which also benefits from Slash arcana, scales with Calogero's bonus Greed, retaliates, and can damage Calogero to trigger his stat boosts regularly."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Calogero_Bloodmoon.png","w":120,"h":98,"c":["Calogero Bloodmoon's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Calogero_Bloodmoon.gif","w":120,"h":94,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Calogero_Bloodmoon_-_LotB_trailer.png","w":200,"h":101,"c":["Calogero as seen in the ",{"t":"announcement trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hzs7c8XppPw"}," of Legacy of the Bloodmoon."]}]}]}]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Calogero's given name stems from the Greek word kalogeros (καλόγερος), meaning \"monk\" (literally \"good old man\"), which also appears in Greek surnames like Kalogeras (Καλογεράς) and Kalogeros (Καλογερος)."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 August 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}